Purpose: Add a Georgia Tech OMSCS AI study mission with a proposed semester
  route, complete selected-course guides, readiness and independent practice.
  Keep academic self-reports, learning evidence and official degree verification
  distinct. Preserve all existing mission editions and browser records.

Tasks:
  [x] Review current public program rules, course pages and dated sample syllabi.
  [x] Trace mission/version, source-library, storage, journal and tutorial contracts.
  [x] Establish a responsive current-source local development preview.
  [x] Add a background mission and original source-linked study curriculum.
  [x] Add an editable proposed semester route and explicit course-status entry.
